<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Self-Directed Search System Login Details</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #eef3f8; color: #111827; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
    .wrapper { width: 100%; padding: 28px 12px; }
    .container { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #d8e1ea; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
    .topbar { height: 6px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2d8bc4 0 42%, #ffeb3b 42% 50%, #f44336 50% 58%, #ffeb3b 58% 66%, #2d8bc4 66% 100%); }
    .header { padding: 24px 28px 18px; background: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7; }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2d8bc4; }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; color: #07183d; }
    .content { padding: 26px 28px 24px; }
    .credentials { margin: 22px 0; border: 1px solid #b7cff0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #ffffff; }
    .credentials-title { margin: 0; padding: 14px 18px; background: #f7fbff; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8e7f1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #07183d; }
    .row { padding: 13px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7; }
    .row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .label { display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #6b7280; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .value { display: block; margin-top: 3px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #07183d; word-break: break-word; }
    .mono { font-family: "Courier New", monospace; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
    .button { display: inline-block; margin: 10px 0 4px; padding: 11px 18px; border-radius: 8px; background: #2d8bc4; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
    .steps { margin: 18px 0; padding: 16px 18px; background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #ffeb3b; border-radius: 8px; }
    .steps ol { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; }
    .steps li { margin: 4px 0; }
    .security { margin-top: 18px; padding: 14px 16px; border-left: 4px solid #f44336; background: #fff7ed; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; color: #374151; }
    .footer { padding: 18px 28px; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="topbar"></div>
      <div class="header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Learner access details</p>
        <h1>Self-Directed Search System</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hello <strong>{{firstName}} {{lastName}}</strong>,</p>
        <p>Your school has created an account for you on the Self-Directed Search System. Use the details below to sign in and complete your career assessment.</p>

        <div class="credentials">
          <p class="credentials-title">Your login details</p>
          <div class="row">
            <span class="label">Login number</span>
            <span class="value mono">{{studentCode}}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <span class="label">Temporary password</span>
            <span class="value mono">{{password}}</span>
          </div>
          {{#if grade}}
          <div class="row">
            <span class="label">Grade / Class</span>
            <span class="value">{{grade}}{{#if className}} - {{className}}{{/if}}</span>
          </div>
          {{/if}}
          <div class="row">
            <span class="label">System link</span>
            <span class="value">{{loginUrl}}</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Open Self-Directed Search System</a>

        <div class="steps">
          <strong>What to do next</strong>
          <ol>
            <li>Open the system link above.</li>
            <li>Sign in with your login number and temporary password.</li>
            <li>Change your password if prompted.</li>
            <li>Complete the assessment and view your results.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="security">
          Keep these details private. If you did not expect this account, please contact your school test administrator.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <strong>Self-Directed Search System</strong><br>
        Ministry of Labour and Social Security - Kingdom of Eswatini<br>
        Powered by Datamatics Eswatini
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
